---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "業績・実績"
description: "論文・学会発表・受賞のリスト"
---
<div class="page-heading container">
  <h1>業績・実績</h1>
  <p>研究室メンバーによる論文・学会発表・受賞歴を紹介します。</p>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__heading">論文</h2>
    <ul class="achievement-list">
      {% for item in achievements.papers %}
      <li>
        <span class="achievement-list__year">{{ item.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="achievement-list__title">{{ item.title }}</p>
          <p class="achievement-list__meta">{{ item.authors }}／{{ item.venue }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section__heading">学会発表</h2>
    <ul class="achievement-list">
      {% for item in achievements.presentations %}
      <li>
        <span class="achievement-list__year">{{ item.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="achievement-list__title">{{ item.title }}</p>
          <p class="achievement-list__meta">{{ item.authors }}／{{ item.venue }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section__heading">受賞</h2>
    <ul class="achievement-list">
      {% for item in achievements.awards %}
      <li>
        <span class="achievement-list__year">{{ item.year }}</span>
        <div>
          <p class="achievement-list__title">{{ item.title }}</p>
          <p class="achievement-list__meta">{{ item.recipient }}／{{ item.organization }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
